        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    lease_payments = [10000, 10000, 10000, 10000, 10000]\n    interest_rate = 0.08\n    residual_value = 15000\n    num_periods = 5\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    present_value = sum(\n        payment / ((1 + interest_rate) ** (i + 1))\n        for i, payment in enumerate(lease_payments)\n    )\n    present_value += residual_value / ((1 + interest_rate) ** num_periods)\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(present_value)\n```",
